guide polestar-completionist-horde/raid-ahnqiraj-temple
title Ahn'Qiraj Temple (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 60-60
zone Silithus
pitch Ahn'Qiraj Temple, in Silithus. A raid.
why Every Horde quest of Ahn'Qiraj Temple: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Silithus: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

